		(uuid "3ff9a46a-ddeb-4dac-a208-b80f4d5be070")
	)
	(text "MICROSD (Molex 5033981892, push-push), SPI mode. 10 kohm pull-ups on CMD, DAT0, CS and the unused\nDAT1/DAT2 as the SD specification asks. Card detect: the two switch contacts (pins 9, 10) close when\na card is inserted, pulling GPIO22 low. Verify pins 9/10 against Molex's drawing (not reachable here)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a76f51a5-f599-428a-964c-1a50debed710")
	)
	(text "WS2812B-V5 STATUS LED on GPIO23. The LED needs a logic high of 0.63 x VDD (3.15 V at 5 V), which a 3.3 V GPIO\nbarely reaches. A series Schottky diode drops VDD to about 4.6 V, so the threshold falls to about 2.9 V.\n100 ohm in the data line; DOUT is unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 139.7 0)
